  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math>.&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Mcjwk",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>",
